dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ei/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust bead identity and alias primitive[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]core-reprefix[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-reprefix: add the Rust-backed collision-safe full-store bead ID [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mapping, canonical event/projection rewrite, persistent old-ID aliases, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact token rewriting, PyO3 bindings, and mixed-prefix lineage tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan, ChangeSpec, and compatibility-page rewriters[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reference-rewriters[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-reprefix[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference-rewriters: add codec-driven plan and ChangeSpec rewrite [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planners plus canonical and old-ID compatibility bead pages, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact-match audit and malformed-input coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Historical agent identity and chat migration[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]agent-history[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-reprefix[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent-history: migrate derived bead-named agents, structured run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifacts, chats, registries, and agents-sidecar bundles while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserving old hosted agent links through explicit compatibility [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]aliases.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Migration CLI and multi-store transaction[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]migration-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-reprefix, reference-rewriters, agent-history[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]migration-cli: expose the default-dry-run migrate-prefix command and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compose deterministic preflight, locking, receipts, recovery refs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]atomic apply, scoped commits, rollback, and resumable publication across[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every target.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]integration-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after migration-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]integration-docs: prove mixed-prefix migration, aliases, immutable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit history, idempotency, and injected recovery paths in a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]multi-repository fixture, then document and run the complete Rust/Python[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation suite.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ei","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ei.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-ei.1"},"source_run_id":"run-871877819034b384916c4ce6d5995610","started_at":"2026-08-03T08:49:29.211823+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f7a635fe52946836076dbc093f835d9678b14eb51a25eb48a8029c3e32399612","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ei.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"53ad6694b729a80a3dd542a3e5cfbc6c1d9f3644dc2670529e27a9c2dd5df631","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ei.5/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"1e51167a9c944553a6a520c0613999f0611a4b7ba203222055cc735cf6aa6d51","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ei.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"state":{"digest":"8427ca6792b8d72ddb9b5f1d7ef442be32ee3ac51c56d2b6485eaca51fb019b0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ei.5/